# TURNIP TRUCK: MUSH MOB. Hordes of mushmen (3 to 12 together, with empty
# streets between) shuffle about. They never hurt: running one over is
# harmless but slows the truck a lot and drags it onto the body, and a truck
# stopped among them loses nothing.
seed 7
game turnip
wait 5
cheat day 3 3
cheat notraffic
wait 46
expect mush >= 3
expect mush <= 12
wait 400
expect mush > 15
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 276
cheat ang 0
cheat vel 2.5 0
cheat mob 1 430 276
wait 14
expect squashed == 1
expect speed100 < 160
expect hearts == 3
# stopped in the middle of a crowd: no harm at all
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 276
cheat stop
cheat mob 1 402 276
cheat mob 1 398 276
cheat mob 1 400 279
cheat mob 1 400 273
wait 300
expect hearts == 3
expect hits == 0
